# Allowlisted production package-level mutable variables in backend/.
#
# archcheck (tools/quality/archcheck) flags any package-level var that is not
# an error sentinel, compile-time assertion, embed.FS value, basic/byte-string
# literal, or non-pointer composite-literal table. Only genuinely
# process-global-by-design values belong here; new entries require a documented
# justification (see the mutable-globals rule in main.go).
#
# Format: <relative-path>:<varName>, one per line.
#
# The middleware rate-limiter singleton is the single allowlisted mutable
# production global. It is a mutex-protected process-global rate-limiting
# instance (not an application dependency); its test hooks are gated to
# APP_ENV=test. Documented in docs/agent-engineering.md (Dependency direction
# and ownership).
backend/internal/middleware/rate_limit.go:limiter
